      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As the play ends to loud applause, Paquita leaps to her feet cheering that Mariona is the all-round actress they have been searching for. Then the school director steps out to invite a VIP guest from the front row up onto the stage: Fernando Canelón. Listen to the scene first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¡Bravo!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¡Ay, que la tenemos! Es ella.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Tiene tres sesenta.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Qué obrón ha hecho. Me voy a poner de pie.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
